### User Authentication

```json
POST https://write.as/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "alias": "username",
  "pass": "password"
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "code": 200,
  "data": {
    "access_token": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
    "user": {
      "username": "username"
    }
  }
}
```

